# Pattern fixture for the kernel_oops stage.regex in alloy-config.yaml (the counter KernelOopsCaptured
# reads). `devbox run prometheus-rules-lint` runs it: the regex is EXTRACTED from the ConfigMap (not
# copied here), applied per line exactly as Alloy does (one kmsg record = one entry, no context), and
# the per-line verdict must equal the first column. Format: `<1|0><TAB><raw kmsg record>`; `#` and
# blank lines are skipped. Expectations come from the CONTRACT (the pattern-set comment in
# alloy-config.yaml: count kernel fault dumps; an OOM-kill dump is not one), never from running it.
